  triage:title "retained_sink_fault_mode returns Result with an unreachable Err path in production" ;
  triage:description "rust-best-practices-agent RBP-F004: crates/atm-daemon-bootstrap/src/daemon_observability.rs:486 fn retained_sink_fault_mode() -> Result<Option<RetainedSinkFaultMode>, AtmError> is #[cfg(not(test))] Ok(None) unconditionally; the Err variant is unreachable in production and the Result wrapper exists only for the test cfg. Minor: simplify (Option, or keep the fallible shape only where it is used). Superseded by the AW1-QA-B2 facade refactor at feature/aw1-tracing-bridge@774272997: retained_sink_fault_mode() moved from crates/atm-daemon-bootstrap/src/daemon_observability.rs into crates/atm-observability/src/lib.rs, where it now has a genuinely reachable Err arm (invalid env value), not an unreachable-Err artifact of a #[cfg(not(test))] stub. quality-mgr independently verified CLOSED at 1106a5db4." ;
